#Expressions

Can be used to save time and extra post processing of the result data
We can use AS keyword when expressions are used in SELECT part of the query, to give a desriptive alias.

##Exapmle-1
List all the movies and their combined sales in millions of dollars

Select title, (Domestic_sales + International_sales)/ 1000000 As combined sales
From Movies
JOIN Boxoffice
ON Movies.id = Boxoffice.Movies_id

##Example- 2
List all the movies that were released on even number years

select title, Year
from Movies
Where Year % 2= 0;
*% Operator: -- Returns remainder after the division
so year % 2= 0 , will return even years like 2002, 1928
while year % 2= 1, will return odd years only like 1981, 2001
